// Everglade, the forest city, as a blockout: the ground, the palisade and
// every building, stall and landmark as a box, the streets and the trails
// out as a path graph, and where each character stands. The plan in words
// is docs/verse/everglade.md; its map (docs/verse/everglade-map.svg) is
// drawn from these numbers by verse/everglade/map.py.
//
// Metres, z north and x west, the fountain at the origin: the engine's
// axes (yaw 0 faces +z, a quarter turn +x), so seen from above with north
// up, +x is to the left. A box is five
// numbers: min x, min z, max x, max z, height. The ground and the paths
// are aethyr/terrain.coax's: a heightfield with rolling hills that rise past
// the walls, levelled where the streets run and flat under the commons,
// the market, the forecourt and each building.
// The checks walk the whole city on a half-metre grid and build its
// ground, so they need a larger step budget than a file's default:
//   coax/bin/coax test --library verse/everglade/plan.coax --steps 2000000000

#load "../../aethyr/terrain.coax";

// Wave 1 of the map's expansion (docs/verse/2026-11-03-everglade-map-gap-analysis.md): the world
// grew from 208 m to 352 m a side, as the previous engine's first expansion grew its glade into a
// town about 272 m across. The old walled town is the middle; the open town (everglade_in_town)
// runs 140 m out from the fountain, round at the corners, and the woods ring it to the edge.
EG_CELLS :: 176;        // the ground's cells a side
EG_CELL :: 2.0;         // metres each
EG_EDGE :: -176.0;      // its west and south edge
EG_BOUND :: 168.0;      // metres from the middle you may walk
// The woods are open: you walk among the trees, round their trunks and rocks, out to EG_BOUND.
// Past it a thicket stands (everglade.coax plant_thicket): dense brush backed by close-set
// trees, so the world's end shows before you reach it.
EG_THICKET :: 169.3;    // the thicket's front row, where its brush's middles stand
EG_RIM_FROM :: 140.0;   // the forest's hills rise from here
EG_TOWN :: 140.0;       // the open town: metres from the fountain east, west, north and south
EG_TOWN_ROUND :: 40.0;  // and the radius its corners are rounded to
EG_RIM :: 0.004;
EG_PATH_HALF :: 1.5;    // a street's half width: three metres across
EG_BOX :: 5;
EG_GAP :: 2.0;          // metres between two buildings, and between a building and the palisade
EG_PROP_GAP :: 1.0;     // between a prop and anything else
EG_CLEAR :: 0.5;        // what a street keeps clear of on either side
EG_RADIUS :: 0.3;       // a walker's capsule (aethyr/player.coax RADIUS)

